# Files in the repo root that should NOT be served as part of the site.
#
# wrangler.jsonc sets `assets.directory` to ".", so by default every file in
# the repository is published, including internal planning documents. Nothing
# here is secret, but docs/PRD.md is an internal roadmap and there is no reason
# for it to have a public URL.
#
# Syntax is gitignore-style. Anything NOT listed here is still served, so the
# pages, css/, js/ and data/ are untouched.

# Internal documentation and planning
docs/
README.md

# Build, test and data-refresh tooling (Python; never executed by the site)
scripts/

# Local UI mockups: gitignored as well, listed here as a second line of defence
_wf-mockup.html
_harness_*.html
_harness_*_driver.js

# Repo and tooling config
wrangler.jsonc
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.github/
